Z||000016||fyerstarter||04-25-2001||10:55 PM||||Here's a question to all the people who say that America is going down the toilet and fast. <P>"To what era would you like to return?"<P>-The 1700's and early 1800's. The totalitarian society in which minorties were kept as slaves, native americans were butchered for their land to "expand the empire", and women were treated as servants?<P>-The late 1800's and early 1900's? The industrial revolution. Big business tycoons in oil and steel created monopolies forcing laborers to work for sub-average pay and prices to skyrocket, a drastic drop in the quality of living leading up to the great depression.<P>-The 20's and 30's? The great depression, prohibition, civilized crime.<P>-The 30's and 40's? WW1 and WW2<P>-The 50's The Cold war<P>-The 60's Vietnam<P>-The 70's Disco! Need I say more..<P>-The 80's Economic recession.<P>-The 90's The gulf war, Economy improves, Clinton gets a blowjob *gasp* :O<P>Well? <P>I know a lot of people will say "I want to go back to the 50's!" When everyone had a job and a  beatiful young wife and 2.5 kids, a house with a white picket fence and a Chevy or Ford in the garage."<P>Really? What if you were black? Do you think you would like to live in the 50's then?<P>My point is this. People can only be afforded the luxury to complain of such insignificant things in times of peace and happiness. It is in those times that people become bored and all of a sudden things such as cuss words on tv, and bad attitudes, and homosexuality, and the media become a "big issue". If we were engaged in World War 3 right now and your sons and daughters were out in the trenches somewhere fighting for their lives would you be worrying about what immoral thoughts the media is "implanting" in their succeptable young minds? <P>Would this thread even exist?<P>I am 20, still a young man by most standards. And I am sick and tired of being underestimated by the older generation in this country. We are perfectly capable of taking care of ourselves and are in no need of assistance from some fat lazy draft dodging yuppy baby-boomer ass-holes who think that violence on tv is the worst problem we have to deal with.<P>[This message has been edited by fyerstarter (edited 04-25-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by fyerstarter (edited 04-25-2001).]||||reg||1
